        {
          "id": "spec001:DIALOGUE-fiber-gardens-menu",
          "speakerId": "narrator",
          "text": "The dock begins with the original uninspected connection and the wavelength-mismatched candidate. Read the cards and select a proposed profile set, then inspect before cleaning or replacement. The dock supplies both suitable interventions; the reusable kit inspects them and is never consumed. Reinspect afterward to confirm removal, then take and submit a fresh preparation reading. Return the dock to its original test condition whenever you want to change candidate profiles or try the other intervention. Restoring does not erase your notebook.",
          "condition": {
            "kind": "objective-complete",
            "objectiveId": "spec001:O02"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
