          "speakerId": "narrator",
          "text": "The first selected path has 10 dB total loss. Choose either reviewed passive path or the high-loss comparison, then measure. A path selection never records a reading or awards a result. Keep the dBm power levels separate from dB loss and reserve. After any change, measure again before submitting. A remembered garden award cannot stand in for a currently prepared connection.",
          "condition": {
            "kind": "objective-complete",
            "objectiveId": "spec001:O02"
          },
          "choices": [
